  "instructions": [
    "Cook the fettuccine according to the package instructions until al dente.",
    "In a separate pan, heat the olive oil over medium heat.",
    "Add the bonito flakes and cook for 1-2 minutes, stirring constantly, until fragrant.",
    "Add the lemon juice and cook for an additional minute.",
    "Stir in the chimichurri sauce and cook for 30 seconds.",
    "Toss the cooked fettuccine with the bonito mixture and top with Parmesan cheese.",
    "Garnish with fresh parsley and serve hot."
